{'symbol': 'CSX', 'date': '2022-05-10 10:00:00', 'title': 'CSX CHIEF FINANCIAL OFFICER TO ADDRESS BANK OF AMERICA SECURITIES TRANSPORTATION, AIRLINES AND INDUSTRIALS CONFERENCE', 'text': 'JACKSONVILLE, FLA., MAY 10, 2022 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- CSX CORP. (NASDAQ: CSX) EXECUTIVE VICE PRESIDENT AND CHIEF FINANCIAL OFFICER, SEAN PELKEY, WILL ADDRESS THE 2022 BANK OF AMERICA SECURITIES 29TH ANNUAL TRANSPORTATION, AIRLINES AND INDUSTRIALS CONFERENCE IN BOSTON ON TUESDAY, MAY 17 AT 8:00 A.M. EASTERN TIME.'}